# Quiz App (Android)

This project is developed as part of my Android Development Internship.

## Project Description
A simple multiple-choice Quiz App that displays one question per screen and calculates the final score.

## Features
- Multiple-choice questions
- One question per screen
- Next / Submit button
- Score calculation
- Result screen

## Technology Used
- Android Studio
- Java
- XML

## Status
Project implementation in progress.
